    4. After all routes are built, scatter additional ORANGE pixels on bg cells (not on any route cell) to reach target density 6-15%. Avoid creating unintended notch structures over route columns.
    5. Verify no route overlap and all right-exits in-bounds.
    6. Strip route coloring (RED/TEAL/YELLOW/GREEN/terminal MARKER) to produce input; keep only bg, ORANGE obstacles, and bottom-row markers.
